%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: GooderMoniRainYori
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh no, is that Sayori?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358570
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I look over toward the sign post, and sure enough-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori!!!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358574
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I begin to run toward her, dropping my arms to let Monika down.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358580
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Is she okay?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358582
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Eager to find that out for myself, I begin a quick overview of her condition.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358583
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Her skin is paler than normal and cold to the touch.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: She is breathing faintly, but steadily.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There's no sign of blood loss or any other major injury.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: She's really cold, but other than that she seems fine...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I grab onto both of her shoulders and begin gently jostling her.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: C'mon Sayori, <i>wake up</i>- it's me...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uhhh... wha-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358589
    - rid: 4351268147175358591
    - rid: 4351268147175358593
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}...?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358590
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}!'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358592
    - rid: 4351268147175358594
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Sayori wraps her arms around me, crying into my chest.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, it's me...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Of course, I hug her back. Gotta warm her up somehow!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: What were you doing out here, Sayori?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358596
    - rid: 4351268147175358597
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I-I was on m-my way to see you guys...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358598
    - rid: 4351268147175358599
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Did something happen?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358600
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I h-had to pee in the middle of the n-night, so I got up a-and-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358611
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358612
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: A-and Yuri, she...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358610
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Yuri...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: She was cutting herself, and-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358613
    - rid: 4351268147175358614
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: <NoiseText=3,1>WHAT?!?</NoiseText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh no...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358615
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Where is she?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358616
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't know!!!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358617
    - rid: 4351268147175358618
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: That's why I went looking for you guys...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358619
    - rid: 4351268147175358620
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright. How long has she been missing?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358621
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Since the middle of last night, I don't know exactly when I woke up...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358624
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm. That's a lot of time, but I don't think Yuri's the one to run into
      the wilderness...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358625
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: If she were to try and get away, I'd say she'd come up with some sort
      of plan, even if not immediately.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I also think she would probably follow the roads if she was going somewhere,
      so-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358626
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, does Winterhold have guards like how Whiterun does?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358627
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... Monika's been taking charge of this whole situation.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I guess she really meant it when she said she wanted to be our club president...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah. Since it's been a while, anyone who say Yuri would probably be
      swapping out at the barracks and have reported their patrol findings already.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358628
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori, did you already try asking a guard where she is?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ... no...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358629
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Then we have our first lead!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358630
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay, you two! Let's find Yuri!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358631
    - rid: 4351268147175358632
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That means you two'll have to let go of each other...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358633
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358634
    - rid: 4351268147175358635
    - rid: 4351268147175358636
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
